+# LAND under APPS on the board (arcade's unit, soroban's gate; stu32-arcade docs/land.md): APPS (blue 0) lists KEYS,
+# BABAL, AIM and LAND; LAND's title, ENTER for a game, the frame rate, then rounds flown blind (the terrain comes from
+# the hardware RNG, so landing is the host's check, stu32-arcade make landcheck): the engine held 3 s, then every
+# round falls and crashes, 200 fuel each, until the tank is empty and GAME OVER shows (about a minute). Then ENTER
+# starts a new game. X prints stack-free before app:, so expect-min comes first (060's gate). C ends LAND, and
+# 2 ENTER 3 + must still give 5.
+send RESTART
+wait STANDIN READY 30
+send X
+expect stack-free
+send K36
+send U36
+send K43
+send U43
+sleep 1
+send K3
+send U3
+sleep 1
+send X
+expect app: LAND
+send K18
+send U18
+sleep 1
+send FRAMEBENCH
+expect framebench: LAND 30
+send K26
+sleep 3
+send U26
+sleep 75
+send K18
+send U18
+sleep 2
+send X
+expect-min stack-free 2048
+expect app: LAND
+send K42
+send U42
+sleep 1
+send X
+expect app: -
+send K38
+send U38
+send K18
+send U18
+send K39
+send U39
+send K46
+send U46
+send X
+expect X=5
